terraform.tfstate*
.terraform/
# The dependency lock. Not committed for the same reason the server module never had one:
# `tofu init` records platform-specific provider hashes, and an org whose operator works
# from a different OS than the one that cut the file gets a lock it must delete to init.
# The version pin lives in versions.tf, which is where a review can see it.
.terraform.lock.hcl
*.auto.tfvars
